! ASTERION FCTA-1 V0.5 APDL template
! Units: mm, N, s, tonne, MPa
! Run in a folder containing the V0.3 line-model include.
! Apply radial loads through Mechanical named selections for best control.
/CLEAR
/FILNAME,ast_v05_ring_centrifugal
/INPUT,../../v0_3/apdl/asterion_line_model,inc
/SOLU
ANTYPE,STATIC
NSEL,S,LOC,X,-21000
D,ALL,ALL,0
ALLSEL,ALL
! Ring 1 and Ring 2 outer nodes are node IDs 169,171,173,174,176,178,179,181,183,184,186,188 and 189,191,193,194,196,198,199,201,203,204,206,208.
! Use a Mechanical cylindrical coordinate load or generate FY/FZ components from the CSV model.
OUTRES,ALL,ALL
! SOLVE only after confirming the radial force vector sum and torque.
FINISH
